From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 18:20:06 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign portfolio: neon-blue glassmorphism with dark/light
 theme

Rebuild the UI in the AW Media style while keeping the same sections
(Home, About, Work, Skills, Testimonials, Contact) and all Sanity queries.

- Theme tokens + persisted dark/light switch (dark by default)
- Glass cards over soft glow blobs, sticky glass navbar with active link
- New hero, filterable work grid, skills/experience cards, brand marquee
- Fix contact form state key (username) and add error state
- Fix testimonial rendering 0 when empty; replace outdated tooltip API
- Add optimized hero image (64 KB webp vs 10 MB png)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
